<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Electronic Data Systems.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Electronic Data Systems.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it downgraded Electronic Data Systems Corp to neutral from strong buy. The analyst was not available for comment.</p>
<p>-- A market source said Morgan trimmed share earnings estimates on EDS from $2.40 for fiscal 1997 to $2.35 and for fiscal 1998 from $2.70 to $2.65.</p>
<p>-- EDS slumped 3-3/4 to 42-3/8 and was the most-active NYSE issue Monday afternoon.</p>
</text>
